  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. create a game object\n\n2. Add a udon component to that game object\n\n3. Make a small udon script that sets the position of the game object to the position of a finger when calling \"Late Update\"\n\n4. Upload the world\n\n5. Join the world in \"VR\" mode\n\n6. The tracked game objects will now behave as if you are on desktop tracking the position right next to your hip , they change position if seating position has been entered\n\n(in the picture one is set to normal update [Left Hand] and the other is using Late Update)",
